  "description": "Yoo Ina, who is psychologically manipulated, abused, and gaslighted by Yoon KyungWon, aims to seek revenge and repair her broken self-esteem by inflicting similar harm and emotional wounds on others in the name of love. Lee SooIn becomes the victim of this twisted desire as Yoo Ina deliberately lures her into her world to escape from Yoon KyungWon’s clutches herself, creating an endless cycle of violence and emotional abuse like an ouroboros.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=807310), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9442769)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[S.Chinese](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/METROPOLIS/ranjin/list?title_no=2386)",
